blocks.en:
Figure A5: Object reconstruction from capture references. Each row shows captured views, the cleaned reference, and a reconstructed
asset. The sink cabinet uses procedural geometry with articulated parts;
the sofa uses image-to-3D generation.

blocks.zh:
图A5:从抓取引用中重建对象. 每行显示捕捉到的视图, 清洁的参考物,以及重建的
资产。 水槽柜采用带有清晰部分的程序几何;
沙发使用图像到3D生成.
